# Night Soil: "{1}, Exile two creature cards from a single graveyard: Create a 1/1 green Saproling creature token." On turn
# 3 each graveyard holds one creature card (Bot2's Grizzly Bears, Bot1's Ornithopter): two in all, but no single graveyard
# has two, so the cost can't be paid and the ability is not offered (CR 118.3; the 2008-10-01 ruling). By turn 5 each
# graveyard has two (Bot1 adds Memnite, Bot2 Savannah Lions): Bot1 may not take one card of each graveyard
# (Ornithopter and Grizzly Bears), takes its own two, and gets a Saproling; Bot2's creature cards stay.

